==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 10

==Battleground==
*1 [[Aku Doge]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Hermit Peng]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mighty Gui Zuli]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Master Da Xun]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

